double-click window 400 ms
the pair      : last 4 now 4 after 120 ms at rate 1000 -> yes  wanted yes  yes
too slow      : last 4 now 4 after 900 ms at rate 1000 -> no  wanted no  yes
different pill: last 4 now 5 after 120 ms at rate 1000 -> no  wanted no  yes
nothing before: last 0 now 4 after 120 ms at rate 1000 -> no  wanted no  yes
exactly 400   : last 4 now 4 after 400 ms at rate 1000 -> yes  wanted yes  yes
just past 400 : last 4 now 4 after 401 ms at rate 1000 -> no  wanted no  yes
no hpet       : last 4 now 4 after 120 ms at rate 0 -> no  wanted no  yes
noted 4 at 7000 -> cell 4 t 7000  a second click 100 ms later doubles yes
cleared -> cell 0  none 0  the same click 100 ms later doubles no  (it must not, which is what stops a third click firing again)
